# Generated output. Marked linguist-generated and -diff so reviews hide it, and
# merge=ours so a conflict resolves to either side; the documented resolution is
# "take either side, then run roadmap gen", which is deterministic and identical
# for both sides at the same source content.
generated/** linguist-generated -diff merge=ours
ROADMAP.md linguist-generated -diff merge=ours
STATUS.md linguist-generated -diff merge=ours
